  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> is defined by&nbsp;<math alttext=\"k left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals x cubed plus 110\"><mi>k</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>110</mn></mrow></math>. What is the value of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"k left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>k</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> when&nbsp;<math alttext=\"x equals 2\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></math>?</p>",
